<th>Range</th>
<th>Deviation from A*</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td>Claude Sonnet 4.5</td>
<td>0.161</td>
<td>[0.080, 0.182]</td>
<td>7.8×</td>
</tr>
<tr>
