λ (generator norm): √(2π) = 2.506628274...
m_a (aperture scale): 1/(2√(2π)) = 0.199471140...
Depth-4 balance: ||Δ|| = 7.3e-14 ✓
S-sector commutator: ||P_S[X,Y]P_S|| = 7.9e-19 ✓
CS chirality: ⟨Ω|U_R|Ω⟩ = 1.0, ⟨Ω|U_L|Ω⟩ = e^(is_p) ✓
</code></pre>
