<li>Entanglement structure from gyrogroup geometry</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>6. Cosmological Structure Formation</strong></p>
<p>Where measurement horizons play essential roles:</p>
<ul>
<li>Cosmic microwave background anisotropies from Q_G = 4π</li>
<li>Large-scale structure from SE(3) symmetry breaking</li>
<li>Inflation from depth-four closure dynamics</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>7. Neutrino Mass Calculation</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Use geometric ratios suggested in paper</li>
<li>Validate against experimental mass differences</li>
<li>Connect to seesaw mechanism via BU structure</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>8. Practical Alignment Tools</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Real-time aperture monitoring for deployed systems</li>
